docs/course-production/shotlists/lesson-18B-script-clean.txt:32:We do daily standups in Slack. Keep them short. How many dials you made. Any standout conversations. Leads that moved stages or got handed off. Anything you're stuck on. And what you're planning for tomorrow. Three to five lines. That's it. Your manager and the team review these to stay aligned on what's happening across the board.
